      "question": "Given that 3^(-1.5) = a*sqrt(3), find the exact value of a.",
      "status": "ready",
      "answer": "a = 1/9",
      "steps": [
        "Write 3^(-1.5) = 3^(-3/2) = 1/3^(3/2).",
        "3^(3/2) = 3 * sqrt(3), so 3^(-1.5) = 1/(3 sqrt(3)).",
        "Rationalise: 1/(3 sqrt(3)) = sqrt(3)/9.",
        "Compare with a*sqrt(3), so a = 1/9."
      ],
